OL,3,GNEWSAFirst results declared Isle of Man
OL,4,Ageneral election
OL,5,
OL,6,FOnchan has been the first constituency
OL,7,Fto declare elected candidates in the
OL,8,F2026 general election, followed closely
OL,9,Fby Douglas South.
OL,11,FTwo new members have been elected in
OL,12,FRamsey, with former commissioners Juan
OL,13,FMcGuinness and Robert Cowell both being
OL,14,Felected.
OL,16,FOnchan has elected scientist Rachel
OL,17,FGlover and Rob Callister keeps his
OL,18,Fseat, meaning that former education
OL,19,Fminister Julie Edge has not been
OL,20,Fre-elected.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
